      "options": {},
      "values": {
        "text": {
          "Text": "First choose a sound in the Main Input panel on the left, under Audio: a microphone, a Sound file, or System audio (what you hear). High jumps about from one frame to the next. The left star reads it straight and jitters; the right one reads it through a Slew, which eases toward each new value, quickly up and slowly down. Turn Rise and Fall down for a lazier star, or switch Shape to Rate Limit."
        }
      },
